   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2013, we&apos;ve invested a total of about $40 million in Equitas, $22 million in equity and $18.1 million in debt.Our investment has supported Equitas as it has grown and diversified the products and support it offers SMEs and individuals, allowing it to reach more poor and unbanked customers with a broader range of financial services.</narrative>
